      "type": "string",
      "value": "SECRET:kfD1b7E4QL2ScMJM0I8QGu5DorsdlGfGuhI6Vx7bbQghGE+uGKKb/yoCwWow2D2reqiUmSBC9MIKu5p19KUj3Iy4oa6FcYsilV78j7h0FOaYGtapVcveQt85jqYqJ3u19DGpJm5MtpWD4NJ5s17RHcINIaCCkzzv3akkCyM85dHSS0l9YjzhnBhZCC48C2feXJtDeBWqW9x5MFF1UXveo2J4//In38LNxTXPjI2q5ulLo6Iv"
